  'bbbd3b8d-336a-4167-a413-3778f185fb66', '11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', '754cf45c-0d59-4879-a1a0-a73723ee7903', 'f355858d-ea5e-4162-a614-d15ee63c7591',
  'JEE_MAIN', 'SINGLE_MCQ', 'EASY',
  'A particle moves along a straight line in 1D Motion such that its velocity is given by $v(t) = 132t^2 - 264t + 3$ m/s. What is its acceleration at $t = 2$ seconds?', 'Differentiating velocity with respect to time: $a(t) = \frac{dv}{dt} = 2(132)t - 264$. Substituting $t = 2$, we obtain $a = 264\text{ m/s}^2$.',
