  '6cb23ee8-ced1-441a-a303-9ab235a0fcfa', '11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003', '6a7d4781-8b91-44df-abb2-a58e654f2bff', 'a463cd07-ce5d-41cf-a79c-f25874723f8f',
  'NEET', 'SINGLE_MCQ', 'EASY',
  'Evaluating the limit in Monotonicity & Extrema: $\lim_{x \to 0} \frac{\sin(2x)}{\tan(3x)}$ is equal to:', 'Using standard limit properties: $\lim_{x \to 0} \frac{\sin(ax)}{\tan(bx)} = \lim_{x \to 0} \frac{\frac{\sin(ax)}{ax} \cdot ax}{\frac{\tan(bx)}{bx} \cdot bx} = \frac{a}{b} = \frac{2}{3}$.',
