  'In an experiment on Self & Mutual Inductance, a block of mass $m = 5\text{ kg}$ is resting on a rough horizontal surface with coefficient of static friction $\mu_s = 0.3$. The minimum horizontal force required to start moving the block is (take $g = 10\text{ m/s}^2$):', 'The limiting static friction is $f_{s,\max} = \mu_s N = \mu_s m g$. Substituting values gives $F_{\min} = 0.3 \times 5 \times 10 = 15.0\text{ N}$.',
