  'd10a7487-9308-4535-a4c5-34b85f125341', '11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', '7b42fedf-686b-4955-ae8d-e783fe8ba10b', 'a8c02169-d437-4545-a2c8-228304cb1791',
  'JEE_MAIN', 'SINGLE_MCQ', 'EASY',
  'A particle moves along a straight line in Moment of Inertia such that its velocity is given by $v(t) = 2256t^2 - 4512t + 3$ m/s. What is its acceleration at $t = 2$ seconds?', 'Differentiating velocity with respect to time: $a(t) = \frac{dv}{dt} = 2(2256)t - 4512$. Substituting $t = 2$, we obtain $a = 4512\text{ m/s}^2$.',
