  'b223764b-1eba-4127-ab39-a75d4fe0465e', '11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', '754cf45c-0d59-4879-a1a0-a73723ee7903', 'f355858d-ea5e-4162-a614-d15ee63c7591',
  'JEE_MAIN', 'SINGLE_MCQ', 'EASY',
  'A particle moves along a straight line in 1D Motion such that its velocity is given by $v(t) = 2508t^2 - 5016t + 3$ m/s. What is its acceleration at $t = 2$ seconds?', 'Differentiating velocity with respect to time: $a(t) = \frac{dv}{dt} = 2(2508)t - 5016$. Substituting $t = 2$, we obtain $a = 5016\text{ m/s}^2$.',
  'PREVIOUS_YEAR', 'JEE MAIN-2013-PHY-Q19', 'APPROVED', TRUE
