  'd2670379-d5fe-44ff-a221-90f267df154f', '11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000003', '0b271bfc-cab4-4d46-ae35-d1b0304e2f87', 'd9cf5ba1-1c57-49f5-a6c2-159699967b33',
  'JEE_MAIN', 'SINGLE_MCQ', 'EASY',
  'Evaluating the limit in Euler & De Moivre Form: $\lim_{x \to 0} \frac{\sin(4x)}{\tan(3x)}$ is equal to:', 'Using standard limit properties: $\lim_{x \to 0} \frac{\sin(ax)}{\tan(bx)} = \lim_{x \to 0} \frac{\frac{\sin(ax)}{ax} \cdot ax}{\frac{\tan(bx)}{bx} \cdot bx} = \frac{a}{b} = \frac{4}{3}$.',
