  'JEE_MAIN', 'SINGLE_MCQ', 'EASY',
  'Evaluating the limit in Equations of Circles & Orthogonality: $\lim_{x \to 0} \frac{\sin(6x)}{\tan(3x)}$ is equal to:', 'Using standard limit properties: $\lim_{x \to 0} \frac{\sin(ax)}{\tan(bx)} = \lim_{x \to 0} \frac{\frac{\sin(ax)}{ax} \cdot ax}{\frac{\tan(bx)}{bx} \cdot bx} = \frac{a}{b} = \frac{6}{3}$.',
