  'JEE_MAIN', 'SINGLE_MCQ', 'MEDIUM',
  'In the context of Concentration Terms, which of the following compounds exhibits maximum paramagnetic behavior?', '$[\text{Fe}(\text{H}_2\text{O})_6]^{2+}$ contains $\text{Fe}^{2+}$ ($d^6$) with a weak field ligand $\text{H}_2\text{O}$, resulting in 4 unpaired electrons ($t_{2g}^4 e_g^2$) and maximum magnetic moment $\mu = \sqrt{4(4+2)} = 4.90\ \text{BM}$.',
